<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-weishu-weishou" book-id="b-weishu-weishou-042" chapter-id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family" source-id="s-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family-ws1516111">
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family:p001:m0000" ref="v8m_39s_b9x_A">寇讚</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family:p001:m0004" ref="v8m_39s_b9x_A">奉國</persName>，上谷人，因難徙馮翊萬年。父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family:p001:m0020" ref="v8m_39s_b9x">脩之</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family:p001:m0024" ref="v8m_39s_b9x">延期</persName>，苻堅東萊太守。<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family:p001:m0034" ref="v8m_39s_b9x_A">讚</persName>弟<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-042-kou-xiuzhi-family:p001:m0036" ref="v8m_39s_b9x_B">謙之</persName>有道術，世祖敬重之，</p>
</text>
